      "title": "Final dividend of ₹1.75 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹1.75. Ex-date: 12th June 2026 Payment date: 2nd September 2026 Dividend yield will be 2.7%, which is higher than the industry average of 1.3%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is covered by both earnings (31% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (56% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 6.5% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 17% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
